---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — CityClick"
  description="CityClick privacy policy. We believe in strict user privacy, zero ad-network tracking pixels, and client-side saved places."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="space-y-4 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-slate-200">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span>🔒</span> Transparency First
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-[#152438] tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Effective Date: October 18, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-[#152438]">1. Zero Invasive Tracking</h2>
        <p>
          CityClick does not sell your personal data, does not install invasive behavioral ad-tracking pixels, and does not sell browsing profiles to third-party data brokers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-[#152438]">2. Local Client-Side Storage</h2>
        <p>
          Your "Saved Places" shortlist is stored directly inside your browser's local storage (`localStorage`). We do not store your saved city list on our servers unless you explicitly create a cloud account.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-[#152438]">3. Public Records & Data Integrity</h2>
        <p>
          The business, municipal, and geographical records presented on CityClick originate from public domain federal, state, and local sources (e.g., US Census Bureau, USGS, EPA, and open civic data portals).
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-[#152438]">4. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          For privacy inquiries or data requests, contact <a href="mailto:privacy@cityclick.com" class="text-[#1D68F2] font-bold hover:underline">privacy@cityclick.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
